    "detailed_description": "Game Overlay Pro is a software that lets you add custom made or premade overlays to any Directx game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274960/extras/57a5f0617e92f5ea14c3e2fc5f5d6720.avif?t=1588243206\" /></div><br>Create your own overlays using texts,images,videos,web pages. These items are fully configurable and lets you design custom overlays.<br>Use fps overlays and track the game performance.<br>Use overlays like clock,timer and other useful utilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274960/extras/fafa6c068e3a3781500d828b58f82faa.avif?t=1588243206\" /></div><br>Game Overlay Pro gives you simple solutions for several problems...<br>If you want to watch a video while you are playing a fullscreen game, you can't keep the video on top. Game Overlay Pro lets you embed the video to games.<br>If you are a streamer and don't have multiple screens, you can also embed the chat and keep an eye for the chat.",
    "about_the_game": "Game Overlay Pro is a software that lets you add custom made or premade overlays to any Directx game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274960/extras/57a5f0617e92f5ea14c3e2fc5f5d6720.avif?t=1588243206\" /></div><br>Create your own overlays using texts,images,videos,web pages. These items are fully configurable and lets you design custom overlays.<br>Use fps overlays and track the game performance.<br>Use overlays like clock,timer and other useful utilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274960/extras/fafa6c068e3a3781500d828b58f82faa.avif?t=1588243206\" /></div><br>Game Overlay Pro gives you simple solutions for several problems...<br>If you want to watch a video while you are playing a fullscreen game, you can't keep the video on top. Game Overlay Pro lets you embed the video to games.<br>If you are a streamer and don't have multiple screens, you can also embed the chat and keep an eye for the chat.",
